    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "friends and family... most of them are just waiting for me to make it easier for them by disappearing. the truth is there's no \"core\" left to salvage. the thing everyone saw on the news, the monster they're talking about... that's all there is now. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life. why should i keep performing this version of \"recovery\" when the person i actually was is already buried?",
